deadline petitioner-reply-period: 60.days after PatentOwnerResponseFiled() counted_by rcfc6 effective [2012-09-16, ..) known_at 2012-08-14 delegable_to [CaseOrder] cite ?("scheduling order: the pack's typical 60 days after the patent owner response; not set by 37 C.F.R. § 42.23")

